    affiliation: "Autonomous Mission Systems Lab (AMSL), Duke University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Autonomous-Mission-Systems-Lab/counter-usv-detection"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
abstract: >-
  Testbed and class–kinematics consistency defense for shore-based counter-USV
  EO detection under adversarial attack. Public artifacts include code, derived
  annotations/features, evaluation freezes, and paper figures. Trained model
  weights are withheld for dual-use reasons and available upon reasonable request.
keywords:
  - maritime
  - USV
  - adversarial robustness
  - object detection
  - AIS
